1214
00:54:55.910 --> 00:54:58.610
Well, Jan is still sleeping in the deleted scenes.
嗯，在删减片段里，简还在睡觉。

1215
00:54:58.790 --> 00:55:01.430
She's like snoring, and everyone's looking at her.
她在打呼噜，大家都在看着她。

1216
00:55:01.430 --> 00:55:07.430
She's covered herself with a plastic tablecloth from the shower, and she wakes up and has
她用一张从淋浴间拿来的塑料桌布盖着自己，然后她醒了过来，

1217
00:55:07.430 --> 00:55:09.730
a pretty amazing exchange with Holly.
和霍莉有了一段非常精彩的对话。

1218
00:55:09.970 --> 00:55:15.330
Where she realizes what we have realized, which is that Holly has a little bit of Michael
在那段对话里，她意识到了我们已经意识到的事，那就是霍莉身上

1219
00:55:15.330 --> 00:55:16.050
Scott in her.
有一点迈克尔·斯科特的影子。

1220
00:55:16.310 --> 00:55:16.650
Yeah.
没错。

1221
00:55:16.830 --> 00:55:18.950
She's making some real Michael Scott jokes here.
她在这里讲了一些很迈克尔·斯科特式的笑话。

1222
00:55:19.130 --> 00:55:19.450
Yeah.
是啊。

1223
00:55:19.610 --> 00:55:21.390
And Jana's like, oh, I get it.
简当时就像是，哦，我明白了。

1224
00:55:21.510 --> 00:55:21.910
Funny.
真逗。

1225
00:55:22.410 --> 00:55:22.730
Mm-hmm.
嗯哼。

1226
00:55:24.010 --> 00:55:27.290
But Astrid is now with Angela and Andy.
但阿斯特丽德现在和安吉拉与安迪在一起。

1227
00:55:27.490 --> 00:55:28.650
I love this scene so much.
我太喜欢这场戏了。

1228
00:55:28.830 --> 00:55:33.230
Angela, please tell me everything about putting all these vegetables on this baby.
安吉拉，请告诉我关于把这些蔬菜放在宝宝身上的一切细节。

1229
00:55:33.510 --> 00:55:33.950
All right.
好的。

1230
00:55:34.130 --> 00:55:36.470
They had the table completely laid out.
他们把桌子完全布置好了。

1231
00:55:36.590 --> 00:55:38.370
They had it all staged.
他们把一切都准备妥当了。

1232
00:55:38.570 --> 00:55:41.730
They had the mom with the baby in the wings standing right there.
他们让妈妈抱着宝宝在侧台候场。

1233
00:55:41.930 --> 00:55:47.170
And literally, right before action, the mom put the baby down, and then I just put that
真的，就在开拍前一刻，妈妈把宝宝放下，然后我就把那片

1234
00:55:47.170 --> 00:55:50.730
big, giant, fake piece of lettuce on the baby.
巨大、虚假的生菜叶放在了宝宝身上。

1235
00:55:50.730 --> 00:55:55.130
It was really hard for me because I was a new mom, and I just was like, okay, I just
这对我来说真的很难，因为当时我刚当妈妈，我心里想的是，好吧，我只想

1236
00:55:55.130 --> 00:55:56.230
want to do this so faSt.
快点完成。

1237
00:55:56.390 --> 00:55:57.550
I want to do the scene so quickly.
我想尽快拍完这场戏。

1238
00:55:57.850 --> 00:56:02.390
And then it was so hard for me as a mom to not really connect with the baby at all and
作为一名母亲，不去和宝宝产生任何情感连接，而只是说，我需要它往这儿看，

1239
00:56:02.390 --> 00:56:04.050
just say, I need it to look up here.
这对我来说真的很难。

1240
00:56:04.210 --> 00:56:05.170
Make it look up here.
让它往这儿看。

1241
00:56:05.610 --> 00:56:07.510
But it's such a window into Angela.
但这真的是了解安吉拉的一个窗口。

1242
00:56:07.890 --> 00:56:09.150
She was a pageant baby.
她小时候就是选美宝宝。

1243
00:56:09.330 --> 00:56:10.910
She dresses up her cats.
她会给她的猫穿衣服。

1244
00:56:11.090 --> 00:56:11.450
Yes.
没错。

1245
00:56:11.650 --> 00:56:15.910
I feel like her kids are going to be dressed up a lot for all kinds of photos.
我觉得她的孩子们以后肯定会被打扮得漂漂亮亮的，拍各种照片。

1246
00:56:15.910 --> 00:56:17.490
And Andy is on board.
而且安迪也完全支持。

1247
00:56:17.490 --> 00:56:25.610
I always imagined that Angela dressed Philip in like the little knee socks and shorts and
我一直想象安吉拉会给菲利普穿那种小长筒袜、短裤和

1248
00:56:25.610 --> 00:56:30.210
suspenders with the little Peter Pan collar that you always see little Prince George wearing.
背带裤，配上那种你总能看到乔治小王子穿的彼得潘领衬衫。

1249
00:56:30.710 --> 00:56:32.730
That's how I imagined Philip dresses.
那就是我想象中菲利普的穿衣风格。

1250
00:56:33.130 --> 00:56:33.690
Oh, yeah.
哦，没错。

1251
00:56:33.870 --> 00:56:38.990
And I also imagined that Angela had like a little sailor suit for him with a sailor hat.
我还想象安吉拉给他准备了一套小水手服，还配了一顶水手帽。

1252
00:56:39.150 --> 00:56:39.990
A hundred percent.
百分之百。

1253
00:56:40.270 --> 00:56:40.910
All of that.
完全是这样。

1254
00:56:41.110 --> 00:56:41.350
Yes.
没错。

1255
00:56:48.230 --> 00:56:51.090
And she is not happy.
而且她很不高兴。

1256
00:56:51.290 --> 00:56:52.510
No, she's irritated.
不，她是感到恼火。

1257
00:56:52.830 --> 00:56:54.350
And she wants to go.
她想走了。

1258
00:56:54.550 --> 00:56:55.330
She's done.
她受够了。

1259
00:56:55.470 --> 00:56:56.070
She's done.
她受够了。

1260
00:56:56.330 --> 00:56:58.070
She finds Michael in the kitchen.
她在厨房找到了迈克尔。

1261
00:56:58.530 --> 00:57:00.230
And she's ready to go.
她准备要走了。

1262
00:57:00.530 --> 00:57:03.150
And Michael insults Holly again.
而迈克尔又一次侮辱了霍莉。

1263
00:57:03.330 --> 00:57:07.550
I guess we've failed to mention that throughout this whole episode, every time Michael,
我想我们之前没提到，在这一整集中，每当迈克尔、霍莉和简在一起时，迈克尔就一直，你知道的，在侮辱她。

1264
00:57:07.690 --> 00:57:12.170
Holly, and Jan are together, Michael just keeps, you know, insulting her.
当霍莉要走进会议室时，他说，呃，人事部。

1265
00:57:12.170 --> 00:57:16.090
When Holly was going to go into the conference room, he's like, ugh, HR.
现在他又说她闻起来像烂番茄。

1266
00:57:16.350 --> 00:57:18.490
Now he says she smells like rotten tomatoes.
还有泥土。

1267
00:57:18.790 --> 00:57:19.470
And dirt.
还有泥土。

1268
00:57:19.870 --> 00:57:20.590
And dirt.
她闻起来像番茄和泥土。

1269
00:57:20.830 --> 00:57:22.450
She smells like tomatoes and dirt.
是啊。

1270
00:57:22.850 --> 00:57:23.150
Yeah.
而且你知道吗？

1271
00:57:23.630 --> 00:57:24.650
And you know what?
简把这一切都看在眼里。

1272
00:57:24.730 --> 00:57:26.010
Jan sees all of it.
简知道迈克尔在做什么。

1273
00:57:26.330 --> 00:57:27.770
Jan knows what Michael's doing.
他送她走到车边。

1274
00:57:28.530 --> 00:57:30.490
And he walks her out to the car.
当她把孩子放进安全座椅时，她转过身来。

1275
00:57:31.030 --> 00:57:33.370
And as she's putting the baby in the car seat, she turns around.
她说，你还能为我做一件事。

1276
00:57:33.470 --> 00:57:35.250
She's like, there is one more thing you could do for me.
他说，什么事？

1277
00:57:35.730 --> 00:57:36.610
And he's like, what?
她说，别和霍莉约会。

1278
00:57:36.770 --> 00:57:38.930
And she says, don't date Holly.
是啊。

1279
00:57:39.370 --> 00:57:39.710
Yeah.
他说，我为什么要讨厌她？

1280
00:57:39.710 --> 00:57:41.830
And he's like, why would I hate her?
我为什么要，呃？

1281
00:57:41.950 --> 00:57:42.830
Why would I, ugh?
你知道，他显然是喜欢她的。

1282
00:57:43.050 --> 00:57:45.210
You know, and he clearly likes her.
是啊。

1283
00:57:45.890 --> 00:57:46.090
Yeah.
简离开了。

1284
00:57:46.930 --> 00:57:47.610
Jan leaves.
她留下了别人送给她的婴儿车。

1285
00:57:47.870 --> 00:57:50.370
She leaves the stroller that was gifted to her.
我知道。

1286
00:57:50.510 --> 00:57:51.210
I know.
太俗气了。

1287
00:57:51.490 --> 00:57:52.490
So tacky.
太俗气了。

1288
00:57:52.810 --> 00:57:54.190
So tacky.
俗气的简。

1289
00:57:54.230 --> 00:57:54.990
Tacky Jan.
办这场迎婴派对的意义是什么？

1290
00:57:55.090 --> 00:57:57.570
What was the point of the baby shower?
为了能小睡一会儿，顺便从迈克尔那儿弄点钱给孩子存大学基金。

1291
00:57:57.910 --> 00:58:02.130
That she could get a nap and maybe get some money out of Michael for a college fund.
就是为了这个。

1292
00:58:02.150 --> 00:58:03.170
That's what it was.
是啊。

1293
00:58:03.290 --> 00:58:03.550
Yeah.
好吧，迈克尔要上楼了。

1294
00:58:03.890 --> 00:58:05.550
Well, Michael is going to go upstairs.
他找到了霍莉，她说，你还会对我刻薄吗？

1295
00:58:05.550 --> 00:58:11.510
And he finds Holly and she says, are you going to still be mean to me?
他只是给了她一个拥抱。

1296
00:58:11.930 --> 00:58:13.750
And he just gives her a hug.
那是一个最温暖、最亲密的拥抱。

1297
00:58:13.930 --> 00:58:16.930
It's the warmest, most intimate hug.
太亲密了。

1298
00:58:17.250 --> 00:58:18.550
It's so intimate.
艾米·瑞恩演得真好。

1299
00:58:19.330 --> 00:58:20.590
Amy Ryan is so great.
她的眼里瞬间盈满了泪水。

1300
00:58:20.870 --> 00:58:22.750
Her eyes just fill with tears.
没错。

1301
00:58:23.250 --> 00:58:29.350
And then Michael has this talking head where he says he didn't feel much when he held Astrid.
然后迈克尔有个采访镜头，他说他抱阿斯特丽德的时候没什么感觉。

1302
00:58:29.350 --> 00:58:34.070
But he, he got a good feeling when he held Holly.
但他抱霍莉的时候，感觉很不错。

1303
00:58:34.530 --> 00:58:36.130
He asked her out on a date.
他约她出去约会。

1304
00:58:36.330 --> 00:58:36.610
Mm-hmm.
嗯哼。

1305
00:58:36.810 --> 00:58:38.730
A real official date.
一次正式的约会。

1306
00:58:39.110 --> 00:58:40.190
She says yes.
她答应了。

1307
00:58:40.530 --> 00:58:41.530
She sure does.
她当然答应了。

1308
00:58:42.010 --> 00:58:44.670
So we're ending with a little love connection there.
所以我们以一段小小的爱情火花作为结尾。

1309
00:58:45.330 --> 00:58:50.870
But now Jim and Pam are both trying to call each other at the same time and they miss each other.
但现在吉姆和帕姆都在试图同时给对方打电话，结果都错过了。

1310
00:58:51.030 --> 00:58:53.190
They both go to voicemail at the same time.
他们同时转入了语音信箱。

1311
00:58:53.590 --> 00:58:56.770
And I remember Greg talking to me about this scene.
我记得格雷格跟我讨论过这个场景。

1312
00:58:56.770 --> 00:59:05.350
I just loved this idea that we're going to hear each side of their voicemail message and you're going to see they really are connected.
我特别喜欢这个点子，我们要听到他们各自的语音留言，你会发现他们确实心有灵犀。

1313
00:59:05.670 --> 00:59:15.370
They both recall this same story about the time that, you know, some man came into the laundromat and Jim had to save Pam and then they bought a washer dryer.
他们都回忆起同一件事，就是有个男人走进自助洗衣店，吉姆不得不保护帕姆，然后他们买了一台洗衣烘干机。

1314
00:59:15.630 --> 00:59:17.490
They're recalling the same event.
他们在回忆同一件事。

1315
00:59:17.710 --> 00:59:21.930
And at the end, they both say, I guess this was just one of those days.
最后，他们都说，我想今天就是这样的一天。

1316
00:59:21.930 --> 00:59:22.950
I miss you.
我想你。

1317
00:59:23.090 --> 00:59:23.950
I wish you were home.
希望你在家。

1318
00:59:24.790 --> 00:59:24.970
Yeah.
是啊。

1319
00:59:24.970 --> 00:59:25.030
Yeah.
是啊。

1320
00:59:25.510 --> 00:59:32.550
Aaron shared with me that he was just so curious how this scene would turn out because you guys filmed it in two different locations.
亚伦跟我说，他当时特别好奇这场戏会拍成什么样，因为你们是在两个不同的地点拍摄的。

1321
00:59:33.190 --> 00:59:35.390
You didn't have the other person there.
对方并不在场。

1322
00:59:35.650 --> 00:59:36.830
No, I couldn't hear John.
是的，我听不到约翰的声音。

1323
00:59:36.830 --> 00:59:38.630
It was like I was really leaving a message.
就像我真的在留语音留言一样。

1324
00:59:38.930 --> 00:59:39.210
Yeah.
是啊。

1325
00:59:39.390 --> 00:59:41.790
And so you guys were just in this vacuum separate.
所以你们就像是在真空里各自表演。

1326
00:59:41.990 --> 00:59:45.910
And then in editing, they were going to find the moment and create it.
然后在剪辑时，他们会找到那个契合点并把它创作出来。

1327
00:59:45.910 --> 00:59:50.730
And he just sort of marveled at how the whole thing came together and just so perfectly.
他当时对整个过程如何完美地融合在一起感到惊叹。

1328
00:59:51.230 --> 00:59:51.450
Yes.
是的。

1329
00:59:51.670 --> 00:59:56.190
Well, I had to really imagine in my head as an actor that I was just leaving a message.
作为演员，我真的必须在脑海中想象我只是在留语音留言。

1330
00:59:56.190 --> 01:00:00.950
So in the script, I could see how our dialogue was going to alternate and sync up.
在剧本里，我能看出我们的对话是如何交替并同步的。

1331
01:00:00.950 --> 01:00:09.550
But I put that out of my mind and I just did my half without thinking of John's lines in my head at all.
但我把这些抛在脑后，完全没去想约翰的台词，只演了我自己的那部分。

1332
01:00:09.830 --> 01:00:09.910
Right.
没错。

1333
01:00:09.910 --> 01:00:11.470
And we filmed it like a monologue.
我们把它当作独白来拍。

1334
01:00:12.130 --> 01:00:12.330
Yeah.
是啊。

1335
01:00:12.450 --> 01:00:13.370
Well, I loved it.
我真的很喜欢。

1336
01:00:13.490 --> 01:00:14.730
I thought it was really sweet.
我觉得非常温馨。

1337
01:00:14.750 --> 01:00:19.530
And it also made me a little sad because you can tell the distance is starting to take a toll.
但也让我有点难过，因为你能看出异地恋开始产生影响了。

1338
01:00:19.530 --> 01:00:20.090
Yeah.
是啊。

1339
01:00:20.630 --> 01:00:22.390
Well, that ends the episode.
好了，这一集就到这里。

1340
01:00:22.710 --> 01:00:25.830
But, Angela, I just realized I skipped a fan question.
但是，安吉拉，我刚意识到我漏掉了一个粉丝提问。

1341
01:00:26.030 --> 01:00:26.350
Okay.
好的。

1342
01:00:26.590 --> 01:00:28.550
And I don't want to leave Evan L.
我不想让埃文·L。

1343
01:00:28.890 --> 01:00:28.950
hanging.
干等着。

1344
01:00:29.290 --> 01:00:29.950
Okay, Evan.
好的，埃文。

1345
01:00:30.490 --> 01:00:40.230
Evan wrote in to say at 17 minutes 30 seconds, was that really rain driving around with the stroller tied to the back of the car or was that a stunt driver?
埃文写信问，在17分30秒时，那是真的在雨中开车拖着婴儿车，还是特技车手开的？

1346
01:00:40.690 --> 01:00:42.610
Well, we had a stunt driver.
嗯，我们确实用了特技车手。

1347
01:00:42.830 --> 01:00:45.090
His name was Sean Crowder.
他叫肖恩·克劳德。

1348
01:00:45.470 --> 01:00:48.590
We also had a stunt coordinator named Wally Crowder.
我们还有一位特技协调员叫沃利·克劳德。

1349
01:00:48.590 --> 01:00:51.950
And so Sean did the driving parts.
所以肖恩负责驾驶的部分。

1350
01:00:52.350 --> 01:00:57.590
Now, you know, there were some shots of rain inside the car, but the other stuff, that was a stunt driver.
当然，有些镜头是在车内拍的雨景，但其他部分，那是特技车手开的。

1351
01:00:58.050 --> 01:00:58.430
Yes.
是的。

1352
01:00:58.530 --> 01:01:02.170
We would often do the driving that was just sort of like where you pull up and stop.
我们经常会拍那种开车戏，就是那种开过来然后停下的镜头。

1353
01:01:02.390 --> 01:01:02.630
Yeah.
没错。

1354
01:01:02.850 --> 01:01:06.890
But then if there was like aggressive driving, that's when the stunt driver would take over.
但如果是那种激烈的驾驶戏，就会由特技车手接手。

1355
01:01:07.050 --> 01:01:07.290
Yes.
是的。

1356
01:01:07.490 --> 01:01:08.950
Well, I loved this episode.
我真的很喜欢这一集。

1357
01:01:09.170 --> 01:01:12.710
I thought it was so good and layered with so much heartfelt stuff.
我觉得它非常棒，而且蕴含了许多感人的内容。

1358
01:01:13.130 --> 01:01:16.870
And before we say goodbye, I have a little bit of trivia for you.
在告别之前，我有个小知识要考考你们。

1359
01:01:17.070 --> 01:01:17.390
Okay.
好啊。

1360
01:01:17.390 --> 01:01:24.490
According to babycenter.com, here are the top girl and boy names in 2008.
根据 babycenter.com 的数据，这是 2008 年最受欢迎的女孩和男孩名字。

1361
01:01:24.850 --> 01:01:26.570
Oh, from when we did this episode.
哦，就是我们拍这一集的时候。

1362
01:01:26.730 --> 01:01:27.290
That's right.
没错。

1363
01:01:27.650 --> 01:01:28.990
Any guesses for the girl?
猜猜女孩的名字是什么？

1364
01:01:30.370 --> 01:01:30.990
Emma.
艾玛（Emma）。

1365
01:01:30.990 --> 01:01:31.830
Yes.
是的。

1366
01:01:32.310 --> 01:01:33.410
You got it.
你猜对了。

1367
01:01:33.610 --> 01:01:35.810
I was thinking maybe because of the friend's baby.
我当时想可能是因为《老友记》里那个宝宝。

1368
01:01:36.150 --> 01:01:36.610
Yes.
没错。

1369
01:01:36.810 --> 01:01:37.810
Rachel had Emma.
瑞秋生了艾玛。

1370
01:01:38.170 --> 01:01:39.510
Really put that name on the map.
那个名字真的是火遍了大江南北。

1371
01:01:39.930 --> 01:01:41.430
Guess what the boy name was.
猜猜男孩的名字是什么。

1372
01:01:41.930 --> 01:01:46.290
I guessed Emma for the girl, like you, but I did not guess right for the boy name.
女孩的名字我和你一样猜的是艾玛，但男孩的名字我没猜对。

1373
01:01:47.210 --> 01:01:47.730
Liam.
利亚姆（Liam）。

1374
01:01:48.510 --> 01:01:48.950
Aiden.
艾登（Aiden）。

1375
01:01:49.670 --> 01:01:50.190
Aiden.
艾登。

1376
01:01:50.690 --> 01:01:52.590
Aiden was the top boy name.
艾登是当时最受欢迎的男孩名字。

1377
01:01:52.590 --> 01:01:54.030
Was that from Sex and the City?
那是出自《欲望都市》吗？

1378
01:01:54.370 --> 01:01:55.490
I don't know.
我不知道。

1379
01:01:55.710 --> 01:01:56.670
I guessed Jack.
我猜的是杰克（Jack）。

1380
01:01:56.930 --> 01:01:57.290
Okay.
好吧。

1381
01:01:57.470 --> 01:01:58.830
He was in the top five.
他排在前五名。

1382
01:01:59.150 --> 01:02:01.310
But Aiden and Emma.
但艾登和艾玛才是第一。

1383
01:02:01.970 --> 01:02:03.250
Well, there it is.
好了，就是这样。

1384
01:02:03.350 --> 01:02:05.230
You've learned some new baby showers.
你们又学到了一些新的迎婴派对知识。

1385
01:02:05.450 --> 01:02:06.290
The Sip and See.
比如“啜饮与观赏”（Sip and See）。

1386
01:02:06.770 --> 01:02:08.890
M&Ms are still printing names.
M&M 豆现在还在印名字呢。

1387
01:02:09.210 --> 01:02:09.650
Yeah.
是啊。

1388
01:02:09.750 --> 01:02:11.810
And the Orbit stroller is actually really good.
而且 Orbit 婴儿车确实非常好用。

1389
01:02:12.230 --> 01:02:14.810
And Emma and Aiden, 2008 babies.
艾玛和艾登，2008 年出生的宝宝们。

1390
01:02:14.970 --> 01:02:15.570
Where are you now?
你们现在在哪儿呢？

1391
01:02:15.770 --> 01:02:18.130
I would love it if an Emma and Aiden got married.
如果能有一对艾玛和艾登结婚，我会觉得特别棒。

1392
01:02:18.570 --> 01:02:19.050
Oh.
哦。

1393
01:02:19.830 --> 01:02:21.450
Well, that was baby shower.
好了，以上就是关于迎婴派对的内容。

1394
01:02:21.590 --> 01:02:22.670
We'll see you next week.
我们下周见。

1395
01:02:22.810 --> 01:02:23.510
Bye, you guys.
再见，大家。

1396
01:02:26.270 --> 01:02:28.970
Thank you for listening to Office Ladies' Second Drink.
感谢收听《办公室女士的第二杯》。

